# Service Visual CMS Norms

## Problem we keep rediscovering

Service pages use `VisualPageEditor`: edit DOM → save `autoHtml` → reload.

**Never** treat React children + leaf-index text remap as the restore path for copy.
That scrambled Features / Process / FAQ and looked like “save failed”.

## Source of truth

| Content | Mode | Behavior |
|---------|------|----------|
| Full page text + images | `mode === "visual-v2"` + `autoHtml` | Render snapshot via `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` (HTML is the page) |
| Legacy uploads only | older `autoHtml` without v2 | Keep React children; restore **images only** |
| No CMS row | — | React component defaults |

- Save must write `mode: "visual-v2"`.
- Do **not** invent `visual-v3` unless also documenting a migration that ignores older modes.
- Do **not** reintroduce leaf-index / order-based text remapping.

## Interactive sections MUST be hydratable

When HTML is the source of truth, React `onClick` / state are gone. Any interactive block needs stable `data-vedit-*` hooks and a hydrate path in `VisualPageEditor`.

Required today:

- Quote: `data-vedit-quote`, `data-vedit-quote-category`, `data-vedit-quote-title`
- Customization: `data-vedit-customization-root|tab|id|detail` — **mount every tab’s image + detail panel** (hide inactive with CSS), never only the active panel
- Features carousel: `data-vedit-features-root|scroller|scroll`

If you add a new interactive control on a service page, add attrs + hydrate in the **same PR**. No “save works, click later” patches.

## Save / sanitize rules

- Capture through `captureSanitizedHtml` / `stripVisualEditArtifacts` only.
- Strip `contenteditable` and edit outlines before persist.
- Repair light-surface contrast (no `text-white` / inline white color on `bg-white` / `bg-slate-50`).
- Merge with existing CMS JSON on PUT; do not wipe unrelated keys.
- Payload limit must allow full-page HTML (currently 5MB).

## Change discipline (no 拆东墙补西墙)

Before changing visual CMS:

1. State which invariant you are preserving (text persist / images / tabs / scroll / contrast).
2. Touch the minimum files; do not redesign unrelated service sections in the same change.
3. Manually verify on `/services/t-shirts/` after deploy:
   - Edit copy → Save → Exit → Reload → copy remains and is readable
   - Customization tabs switch image + copy
   - Features arrows scroll cards
   - Quote button opens modal
4. If a fix needs “ignore old snapshots”, document the mode flag — do not silently drop user uploads.

## Out of scope for VisualPageEditor

About / Home path-based `EditableText` CMS is a different system. Do not mix the two models on one page without an explicit design.
